---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Remote Team Partners"
  description="How Remote Team Partners collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
  path="/privacy/"
  base="../"
>
  <section class="hero hero-slim">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="../">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="cur">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="sec-head left">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Legal</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy.</h1>
        <p>Last updated: October 2026. Your information is yours, we just borrow it to serve you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec" style="padding-bottom:88px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you give us directly, such as your name, work email, company, and the contents of messages you send through our contact form or by email. We also collect basic technical information when you visit our site, such as your browser type and pages viewed. See our <a href="../cookies/">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

        <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
        <p>We use your information to respond to enquiries, prepare proposals, deliver our services, and improve our website. We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it with third parties for their own marketing.</p>

        <h2>3. Sharing</h2>
        <p>We share information only where needed to operate: with service providers who process data on our behalf (for example, email and hosting providers), and where required by law. Our providers are bound to handle your data securely.</p>

        <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
        <p>Enquiry messages are kept for up to 24 months so we can follow up on conversations. Client engagement records are kept for the duration of the engagement and as required by tax and employment law.</p>

        <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can ask us at any time to show you the personal information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it. Email <a href="mailto:hello@remoteteampartners.com">hello@remoteteampartners.com</a> and we will respond within 30 days.</p>

        <h2>6. Security</h2>
        <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information, including encrypted connections (HTTPS) and restricted access. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

        <h2>7. International transfers</h2>
        <p>Our team operates across regions. Where your information is transferred internationally, we take steps to ensure it remains protected to a comparable standard.</p>

        <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The current version is always published on this page with its last-updated date.</p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:hello@remoteteampartners.com">hello@remoteteampartners.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
